00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:06,000
Virtuality is a 2009 American science fiction drama television film directed
by Peter Berg and written by Michael Taylor and Ronald D.

13
01:02:50,000 --> 01:02:56,000
Originally filmed for the Fox network as a television pilot for a series that was not
commissioned, it aired on the network as a standalone film on June 26, 2009.

14
01:07:40,000 --> 01:07:46,000
It features the crew of Phaeton, a spaceship designed to search for a hospitable planet in
a nearby star system after an ecological catastrophe in near-future Earth.

15
01:12:30,000 --> 01:12:36,000
While approaching the point of no return, the crew experiences problems with their virtual
reality entertainment system, which quickly escalate and threaten their mission.

16
01:17:20,000 --> 01:17:26,000
The film explores themes of virtual reality, romance, space.

17
01:22:10,000 --> 01:22:16,000
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking and intense.
